insert into public.passages (id, code, skill_id, sat_alignment, grade_band, title, body, status)
values ('0cddfb6d-72ee-5fb5-b73b-29af6df5e1de', 'rg4-comparing-texts-p04', (select id from public.skills where slug = 'read-g4-comparing-texts'), null,
        '3-5', $q$First Try$q$, $q$Text 1: Down the Hill (a story from Norway)

Sindre had never skied before. His cousins zoomed down the snowy hill, laughing. Sindre stood at the top with wobbly knees.

"What if I fall?" he asked.

"Then you get up," said his cousin Ingrid. "Everyone falls at first."

Sindre pushed off. He slid, tipped and landed in a soft pile of snow. His cheeks turned pink. But Ingrid was clapping. He stood up, brushed off his jacket and tried again. This time he made it halfway down. By the end of the day, he reached the bottom without falling once.

Text 2: The Circle (a poem from Brazil)

The drums go boom.
The people clap.
They stand in a circle
and sing.

My turn to step in.
My feet feel like stone.
What if I forget
every move?

I cartwheel. I spin.
I slip, and I stumble.
But no one laughs.
They sing even louder.

So I try once more.
My feet find the beat.
Now the circle
feels like home.$q$, 'draft')
