   $q$According to the passage, why did riders switch to a fresh horse at each station?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Each station owned only one horse.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"Tired horses could not run fast.","is_correct":true},{"text":"The horses had to carry the mail bag home.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"The riders wanted to rest and sleep.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-detail"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Tired horses could not run fast.$q$, $q$Paragraph 2 says, "Tired horses could not run fast, so the switch saved a lot of time." The passage never says the switch was so riders could rest.$q$, 'draft', 'ce3bd806-2863-5b11-aed8-12e10154e5d7')
