   $q$Which of these is meant to be spoken aloud by an actor?$q$, $q$[{"text":"\"A living room on a rainy Saturday.\"","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-drama-parts"},{"text":"\"The doorbell rings.\"","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-directions-with-dialogue"},{"text":"\"Sits on the couch.\"","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-directions-with-dialogue"},{"text":"\"Here you go. Front row seat.\"","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$"Here you go. Front row seat."$q$, $q$"Here you go. Front row seat." comes after JUNO's name and is her dialogue. The other choices come from stage directions or the setting, which tell what happens but are not spoken.$q$, 'draft', 'd235f142-7dc9-5d1b-ae55-c893a4387c25')
