   $q$What can the reader infer about why Wen's mother shook Priya's hand for a long time?$q$, $q$[{"text":"She wanted to ask Priya to teach Wen how to kick.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"She was congratulating Priya for scoring the goal.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-characters"},{"text":"She was apologizing because Wen took Priya's kick.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"She was thankful that Priya gave Wen her chance.","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$She was thankful that Priya gave Wen her chance.$q$, $q$Priya gave up the kick so Wen could score, and the long handshake shows deep thanks. Wen, not Priya, scored the goal.$q$, 'draft', '7119c905-b04e-5530-ab70-91b8150c003e')
